      ],
      "title": "Text String (User Prompt)",
      "properties": {
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "ver": "0.25.0",
        "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "An extraordinary ultra-wide cinematic environment painting of a magnificent fictional Japanese-inspired metropolis, viewed from inside an elevated commuter train through a broad panoramic side window.\n\nA vast romantic metropolitan civilization unfolds outside the train, dominated by a monumental multi-level railway interchange of extraordinary scale and design. Sweeping elevated railways, layered transit corridors, elegant platforms, dense urban districts, modern towers, and distant skyline clusters create immense depth and a breathtaking sense of urban grandeur. The city should feel clearly fictional and visionary rather than like an ordinary real-world Japanese city. Introduce subtle but unmistakable speculative urban wonders: colossal civic structures in the far distance, unusually grand architectural complexes, vast elevated connections between districts, and distant cloud-adjacent megastructures that make the metropolis feel more extraordinary, more poetic, and more imagined than reality.\n\nThe viewing angle is clearly from a passenger seat looking sideways through the train window, not a driver's forward-facing view. Only a slim portion of the train window frame is visible at the image edges, while the exterior city panorama remains the dominant subject.\n\nUse a luminous cool-neutral evening palette with silver-lilac, pale lavender, soft mauve, pearly white, faint rose, and restrained cool gray-green accents. Avoid heavy cobalt-blue dominance, avoid dull gray desaturation, and avoid classic orange-gold sunset flooding the whole frame. The sky should be majestic and emotionally expansive, filled with immense sculptural cloud formations whose edges catch delicate pink-lilac and pearly light, creating a richer and more enchanting atmosphere. The city lights are beginning to glow softly, adding warmth and life without overpowering the cool luminous atmosphere.\n\nThe image should feel more dreamlike, more visionary, and more romantically elevated than a realistic cityscape. Emphasize cinematic environmental richness, nuanced tonal transitions, atmospheric layering, sophisticated light scattering, and integrated painterly depth. The buildings should not read as flat blocky color shapes; instead, they should feel richly unified within the atmosphere, with more subtle surface variation and more coherent environmental painting.\n\nA single delicate meteor crosses the sky as a small poetic accent. The overall mood is uplifting, beautiful, awe-inspiring, and full of quiet wonder: a believable world emotionally, but an extraordinary world visually.\n\nPremium cinematic digital matte painting, sophisticated animated-film background art, visionary metropolitan worldbuilding, meticulous architectural design, rich environmental detail, elegant tonal hierarchy, atmospheric perspective, and compelling visual focus.\n\nDo not make it rural, nostalgic countryside rail, cyberpunk neon, low-detail cartoon, photoreal architectural visualization, or an ordinary realistic city skyline."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "value": "An extraordinary ultra-wide cinematic environment painting of a magnificent fictional Japanese-inspired metropolis, viewed from inside an elevated commuter train through a broad panoramic side window.\n\nA vast romantic metropolitan civilization unfolds outside the train, dominated by a monumental multi-level railway interchange of extraordinary scale and design. Sweeping elevated railways, layered transit corridors, elegant platforms, dense urban districts, modern towers, and distant skyline clusters create immense depth and a breathtaking sense of urban grandeur. The city should feel clearly fictional and visionary rather than like an ordinary real-world Japanese city. Introduce subtle but unmistakable speculative urban wonders: colossal civic structures in the far distance, unusually grand architectural complexes, vast elevated connections between districts, and distant cloud-adjacent megastructures that make the metropolis feel more extraordinary, more poetic, and more imagined than reality.\n\nThe viewing angle is clearly from a passenger seat looking sideways through the train window, not a driver's forward-facing view. Only a slim portion of the train window frame is visible at the image edges, while the exterior city panorama remains the dominant subject.\n\nUse a luminous cool-neutral evening palette with silver-lilac, pale lavender, soft mauve, pearly white, faint rose, and restrained cool gray-green accents. Avoid heavy cobalt-blue dominance, avoid dull gray desaturation, and avoid classic orange-gold sunset flooding the whole frame. The sky should be majestic and emotionally expansive, filled with immense sculptural cloud formations whose edges catch delicate pink-lilac and pearly light, creating a richer and more enchanting atmosphere. The city lights are beginning to glow softly, adding warmth and life without overpowering the cool luminous atmosphere.\n\nThe image should feel more dreamlike, more visionary, and more romantically elevated than a realistic cityscape. Emphasize cinematic environmental richness, nuanced tonal transitions, atmospheric layering, sophisticated light scattering, and integrated painterly depth. The buildings should not read as flat blocky color shapes; instead, they should feel richly unified within the atmosphere, with more subtle surface variation and more coherent environmental painting.\n\nA single delicate meteor crosses the sky as a small poetic accent. The overall mood is uplifting, beautiful, awe-inspiring, and full of quiet wonder: a believable world emotionally, but an extraordinary world visually.\n\nPremium cinematic digital matte painting, sophisticated animated-film background art, visionary metropolitan worldbuilding, meticulous architectural design, rich environmental detail, elegant tonal hierarchy, atmospheric perspective, and compelling visual focus.\n\nDo not make it rural, nostalgic countryside rail, cyberpunk neon, low-detail cartoon, photoreal architectural visualization, or an ordinary realistic city skyline."
      },
